 ## Background
-Transparent illustration has been an open problem in the graphics community [S1, S2, unofficial]. This technique proposes that the problem becomes simple if rapid voxelization is feasible [S1, S2, unofficial]. It is based on the multivalued voxelization algorithm [S1, S2, unofficial]. The approach is promising for applications such as surgical planning, intra-operation navigation, and radiation therapy [S1, S2, unofficial].
